Yeah. And then finally, at the end, you're, like, collecting baseballs along the way, and you're like, hi, Junior.

00:23:23.460 --> 00:23:24.680
There's, like, a very, I'm trying to remember what it is.

00:23:24.800 --> 00:23:26.320
It's just, like, a heartwarming message.

00:23:26.340 --> 00:23:30.180
Like, ah, I'm here for your, you know, to be always there for you, Junior, or something like that.

00:23:30.180 --> 00:23:31.280
It's Mappy Junior's birthday.

00:23:31.740 --> 00:23:37.280
Yeah. And I was just like, wow, now I feel a connection to Mappy.

00:23:37.460 --> 00:23:41.140
I'm like, well, this is some character development in this game.

00:23:41.160 --> 00:23:45.260
And now he's an S-tier mascot for Band of Namco.

00:23:45.420 --> 00:23:51.320
Exactly. Yeah, he says to his son, I'm looking at the net right now, I wish you many happy returns of the day, Junior.

